{
  "name": "Pokemon MOBA Overhaul",
  "author": "Sirvalkyerie",
  "version": "0.2.13",
  "description": "This is a complete overhaul mod and is not meant to be compatible or balanced with either base game champions or other mods. This mod currently contains 103 Pokemon. While creating a new game click Custom for the Champion Pool, deselect all base game champions and select each of the 103 Pokemon. Including base game champs in your game may cause crashes.\n\nThis is a Beta version of a mod that's in active development. There are some features not yet implemented and there are some features the Devs have not yet made possible via the current modtools. Namely, this is a Rust mod featuring all new functions such as type effectiveness and STAB as well as brand new passives for each Pokemon. SDK 0.6.4 now supports native combat statistics and direct VFX/SFX events. This build uses native VFX bindings and engine combat statistics. Visual placement, timing, and combat statistics are undergoing in-game validation.\n\nThere is an active Discord for the mod here ( https://discord.gg/mB8dyd4Qw ) where you can get faster updates than are provided to the Steam Workshop. You can also report issues with bugs and balancing in the Discord.\n\nIf you'd like to help, I need someone interested in doing the art to help me create new base map assets. Please reach out on Discord.\n\nLastly, every single Pokemon has a basic attack, two skills, an ultimate, and a passive ability. The in-game UI can only show the two skills and ultimate in the Game Info screen. The passives can change how the Pokemon behave significantly. As such, I've included a guide with the mod that you can find inside the mod folder inside of a folder called guide. The guide is also available on the Discord. Please read the guide to learn about the Pokemon in the game, their moves, their synergies and their counters. Make sure you've read the guide before reporting bugs. And again, please make all bug reports on the Discord server.\n\nThank you!\n\n[Code Mod Notice]\nThis package contains native/executable code files. Enabling it allows code to run inside the game process. Use only mods from creators you trust.\nFiles: pokemon_moba_stable.dll.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-19",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.4"
    }
  ]
}
